rVV10 nonlocal correlation (vdw_method rvv10, libvdwxc) on top of PBE through the native XC path for zincblende
GaAs with nonlinear core correction pseudopotentials and two spin channels: energy, forces (As displaced) and
stress. b is set explicitly because the PBE pairing has no published value. The native path is used on purpose:
in PW, the stress of a libxc functional with NLCC pseudopotentials counts the core term twice (a separate,
pre-existing issue, to be reported).
Requires ENABLE_LIBXC and ENABLE_LIBVDWXC; listed in CASES_LIBVDWXC.txt. The reference was generated with 4 MPI ranks.
